  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="task-202 punch list verification obligation">Executor MUST grep-verify current spec.md SC #2 wording BEFORE amending — confirm the wording still matches punch list description (has not been amended since verification pass 2026-08-24 SESSION 7).</constraint>
    <constraint source="Wave G-6 retired-on-disk convention">Amendment MUST retain the prohibition on ACTIVE registration of retired classes. The banner is on-disk-only; DI module must NOT `services.AddSingleton<TInterface, RetiredClass>()`. If a task retires a class but leaves the registration active, SC #2 amended version STILL FAILS.</constraint>
    <constraint source="root CLAUDE.md §11 Component Justification">Amendment-only (edit existing spec); §11 does not trigger.</constraint>
  </constraints>

  <knowledge>
